      "sourceText": "调小通常保留更多细节，代价是计算量增加；原始数据没有的细节不会因调小而出现。远处点稀疏、墙角或小柱子能否稳定描述，需看实际数据；人员、敌车等动态点在本节点没有专门筛除，实时点更多也可能带来更多干扰。",
      "translatedText": "Reducing the setting usually retains more details, at the cost of increased computation; details absent from the raw data will not appear merely because the setting is reduced\\. Whether distant sparse points, wall corners, or small pillars can be described stably depends on the actual data; dynamic points such as personnel and enemy vehicles are not specifically filtered out at this node, and more real\\-time points may also introduce more interference\\.",
