      "sourceHash": "41031ee0f8963ab78b7b446e2f7e2adf60a242aef0050bea834843b4d2ab3824",
      "contextFingerprint": "334381918947006220c8b5c8283d156f6a6b45bd733498b9b44cda81462f819d",
      "sourceText": "回调函数不是一种新的函数类型。“回调”描述的是函数的使用方式：调用者把函数地址交给另一段代码，另一段代码在需要时调用这个函数。",
      "translatedText": "A callback function is not a new type of function\\. \"Callback\" describes how a function is used: the caller hands the function address to another piece of code, and that other piece of code calls this function when needed\\.",
      "provider": "deepseek",
      "model": "deepseek-flash",
      "usage": {
        "inputTokens": 165,
